Package: wickratimemachine
Type: Package
Title: Reconstruct Recorded Crypto Market Microstructure at Any Past Moment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("kingchenc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@wickra.org")
Description: R bindings for wickra-timemachine over its C ABI hub: a deterministic
    re-fold reconstructs the byte-identical market microstructure snapshot at any
    recorded timestamp - the same protocol as the CLI and every other binding.
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-timemachine
BugReports: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-timemachine/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: the wickra-timemachine C ABI shared library (WKTIMEMACHINE_LIB)
    and its header (WKTIMEMACHINE_INC).
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
